  "body": "Side branch: side/path-kernel\n\nSync PR by the rule **Side branch** of `AGENTS.md`: `main` at `79ca6a088` (v0.27.0 and the commits after it) is merged into `side/path-kernel`. The side branch has no commit of its own yet (it is at `dc5a34dd1`, an ancestor of `main`), so the merge has no conflict and no hand edit. Class SAME: no review is necessary.\n\nThis sync carries PR #3997 (the Face start and exit picks in the old Face planner), as the maintainer asked at the cut.\n\nAfter the merge, the tree of the side branch is the tree of `main` at `79ca6a088`. The batch gate of that tree ran on `main`. Thus no extra local batch gate runs for this sync.\n\nChangelog: none\nRefs #4023\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
